<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#FSCA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action taken by a manufacturer to reduce the risk of death or serious deterioration in health associated with a medical device already placed on the market." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#FSCA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Field Safety Corrective Action" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableActiveDevice
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableActiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableActiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Device> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableActiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical device intended to be totally or partially introduced into the human body and remain there after the procedure, requiring a source of energy to operate." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableActiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implantable Active Device" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableDevice
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Device> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical device intended to be placed inside the human body, either permanently or for a prolonged period." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Implantable Device" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InSituCorrection
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InSituCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InSituCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#FSCA> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InSituCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A corrective action performed directly on the device at its location without removing it from service." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InSituCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Situ Correction" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InVitroDiagnosticDevice
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InVitroDiagnosticDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InVitroDiagnosticDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Device> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InVitroDiagnosticDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A device used to perform tests on samples such as blood or tissue taken from the human body." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InVitroDiagnosticDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Vitro Diagnostic Device" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An event related to the use of a medical device that has caused or could potentially cause harm." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Incident" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InfectionRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InfectionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InfectionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InfectionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk of infection caused by contamination or improper sterilization of the device." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InfectionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Infection Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InjuryRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InjuryRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InjuryRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InjuryRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk of physical harm or injury resulting from the use of a device." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InjuryRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Injury Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InterferenceRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InterferenceRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InterferenceRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InterferenceRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk caused by external interference affecting the device’s operation" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#InterferenceRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Interference Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MalfunctionRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk associated with device malfunction or incorrect functioning" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Malfunction Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Manufacturer With Serious Incident" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ManufacturerWithSeriousIncident" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MaterialRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MaterialRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MaterialRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MaterialRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk arising from the materials used in the device, such as toxicity or incompatibility." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#MaterialRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#NearMissIncident
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#NearMissIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#NearMissIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#NearMissIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "An incident that did not result in harm but had the potential to do so under slightly different circumstances." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#NearMissIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Near Miss Incident" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An organization responsible for designing, producing, packaging, and labeling a medical device before placing it on the market." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Manufacturer" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> "https://dbpedia.org/resource/Manufacturer" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarm
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An error in diagnosis caused by incorrect or misleading results from a medical device." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PatientHarm" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Incident where patient is harmed" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PatientHarmIncident" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#PatientHarmIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> "https://dbpedia.org/resource/Adverse_event" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ProductQuality
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ProductQuality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ProductQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ProductQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A defect or deficiency in a device that affects its quality, safety, or performance." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#ProductQuality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Product Quality Issue" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RadiationRisk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RadiationRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RadiationRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RadiationRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk associated with exposure to radiation emitted by a device." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RadiationRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Radiation Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Recall
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#FSCA> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action aimed at returning or removing a medical device from the market due to safety concerns." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Recall" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A classification category used to group different types of risks associated with medical devices." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#RiskType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Type" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SafetyAlert
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#FSCA> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A formal notification issued to inform users about potential risks or safety issues related to a device." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Safety Alert" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SelfTestDevice
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SelfTestDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SelfTestDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Device> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SelfTestDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A device intended to be used by laypersons for diagnostic purposes without professional supervision." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SelfTestDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Self-Test Device" .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SeriousIncident
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#Incident> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Serius Incident" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#SeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SeriusIncident" .
